# An L-shaped barndominium: a 44×40 main block with a 24×22 primary-suite wing
# projecting east. The `wing` statement adds a footprint block; the building
# outline, containment, exterior walls and area all follow the L, not a rectangle.
plan "Maple Hollow"
envelope 44 x 40
wing 24 x 22 at 44,0
ceiling 10

# --- main block (0..44 x 0..40) ---
room living:  living    at 0,0    size 26 x 22
room kitchen: kitchen   at 26,0   size 18 x 22
room hall:    hallway   at 0,22   size 44 x 5
room bed1:    bedroom   at 0,27    size 22 x 13
room bed2:    bedroom   at 22,27   size 22 x 13

# --- east wing (44..68 x 0..22): primary suite ---
room master:  bedroom   at 44,0   size 24 x 14
room mbath:   bathroom  at 44,14  size 12 x 8
room mcloset: closet    at 56,14  size 12 x 8

door living - kitchen   width 6
door living - hall      width 3
door hall - bed1        width 2.67
door hall - bed2        width 2.67
door kitchen - master   width 2.67
door master - mbath     width 2.67
door master - mcloset   width 2.5

entry living south width 3 offset 1
window living  south width 14 offset 6
window kitchen south width 10 offset 4
window bed1    north width 7  offset 7
window bed2    north width 7  offset 7
window master  east  width 6  offset 4
window master  south width 8  offset 8
